{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is this place? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is its purpose? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Why are you here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE DREAMER</strong> lies until the work is completed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prismania</strong> is a surreal puzzle adventure game. After waking up in a strange triangle-shaped well full of strange mechanisms, you must solve prism puzzles to escape and figure out how you ended up there and what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/f1a92b6132ec1a9355a271c4130eb817.poster.avif?t=1771462539\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/f1a92b6132ec1a9355a271c4130eb817.webm?t=1771462539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/f1a92b6132ec1a9355a271c4130eb817.mp4?t=1771462539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move laser beams</strong> in dozens of boards with increasingly complex prism and modifier pieces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the well in which you are trapped while you discover <strong>cryptic surreal videos</strong> that will give a new perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videos, environment and boards. Everything is connected to provide <strong>complex and interesting puzzles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative without texts or dialogues</strong>. Interpret the facts and find out what is going on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/b002597b791f29179a89e15cfdf6a856.poster.avif?t=1771462539\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/b002597b791f29179a89e15cfdf6a856.webm?t=1771462539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/b002597b791f29179a89e15cfdf6a856.mp4?t=1771462539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/295234c3d6fa129239986fd31be293f8.poster.avif?t=1771462539\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/295234c3d6fa129239986fd31be293f8.webm?t=1771462539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/295234c3d6fa129239986fd31be293f8.mp4?t=1771462539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542240?t=1771462539","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/4483f18ef103a0108e1b5bdd9ab9533008b54739/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771462539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/8431f9bc580b189118f4b952fcf5a33a16981246/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771462539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/8431f9bc580b189118f4b952fcf5a33a16981246/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771462539","categories":[{"description":"Sin